    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PageIndex Workflow for Knowledge Base - Delete\n\n## Purpose\nMirrors knowledge-base file deletions into PageIndex so the chatbot's primary KB tool stops retrieving content for files that no longer exist. Called by the RAG Delete workflow on both of its deletion paths (scheduled Drive-sweep and direct sub-workflow call) so PageIndex stays consistent with Pinecone regardless of how the deletion was triggered.\n\n## How it works\n- Receives `fileId` + `fileName` from the caller\n- Lists all PageIndex documents and finds the matching entry by fuzzy-matching the base name\n- If a match exists, sends a DELETE request to the PageIndex `/doc/{id}/` endpoint (errors are tolerated so an already-missing doc does not block the run)\n- Always upserts the PageIndex_File_Tracker row (status = deleted) so the tracker reflects reality even if the PageIndex doc was never created\n\n## Triggered by\nExecute Workflow trigger  invoked as a sub-workflow with `fileId` + `fileName`.\n\n## Called by\n- RAG Workflow for Knowledge Base - Delete (called from BOTH the scheduled-sweep path after the tracker row is marked deleted, AND the direct sub-workflow path)\n\n## Reads/writes\n- Calls the PageIndex API (lists docs, deletes the matched doc)\n- Upserts Google Sheets `Customer_Support_Data`  `PageIndex_File_Tracker`",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview-doc",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1104,
        112
      ]
    }
